DSP is designed to be configured by adopters. Labels, hierarchy depth, themes, and KPIs can be adjusted without rewriting the core product.

## Already configurable in this version

- Hierarchy labels (Level 1, Level 2, Level 3) via `GET /config/installation`.
- Home always uses 2 levels; Downloads always uses 3 levels.
- Territory options via `GET /territory/options?level=&parentId=`.
- Home KPIs (up to 5 cards; first card is always area of interest) via installation config.
- Detail panel fields and labels for identifier search.
- Download themes and available file formats.
